<title>MEXICO: Geplacea sugar group to meet in Peru, Nov 25-28.</title>
<headline>Geplacea sugar group to meet in Peru, Nov 25-28.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latin American and Caribbean Sugar Exporters Group, known by its Spanish intials as Geplacea, will hold its annual meeting in Trujillo, Peru, November 25-28.</p>
<p>The Mexico City-based intergovernment organisation made up of 23 countries will discuss restructuring its make-up given changes in international sugar markets, Geplacea said Tuesday in a statement.</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
